OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright end
OL,6,Fto the afternoon with sunny spells
OL,7,Fgiving way to clear spells overnight.
OL,8,FTurning increasing cloudy from the
OL,9,Fwest from midnight with outbreaks of
OL,10,Fheavy and thundery rain arriving.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,13,Fheavy spells of rain, clearing
OL,14,Feastwards during the day. Turning
OL,15,Fbrighter from the west during the
OL,16,Fafternoon with sunny spells and
OL,17,Fshowers following.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
